# Canonical reviewed solution: directly authored binary, not assembler output.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111000 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,0 | Start at the unsigned lower boundary.
00101101 00000001 00000000 # instruction | SUB AX,1 | Zero minus one wraps to FFFF and sets the borrow flag CF.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop with AX=FFFF, CF=1 and ZF=0.
